# Build-context exclusions for docker/Dockerfile.
#
# This lives at the repository root rather than next to the Dockerfile because the
# per-Dockerfile form ("<dockerfile>.dockerignore") is a BuildKit-only feature, and
# the legacy builder still shipped by Ubuntu's docker.io package silently ignores it.
# The root form works with both.
#
# It keeps the context small and, critically, stops a local build/ tree from being
# copied into the image, where it would shadow the prebuilt dependencies.

.git
.github
build/
**/build/
**/results/
**/__pycache__/
*.o
*.a
*.so
output.json
.experiment.json

# Large artifacts that are not needed to compile or run experiments
sosp-replication/data/
doc/html/
doc/latex/

# Local editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
